  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759246,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 101-in-1 Sports Party Megamix - Nintendo Wii\n\nGet ready for the ultimate sports extravaganza with *101-in-1 Sports Party Megamix* for the Nintendo Wii! This collection delivers a massive dose of competitive fun, featuring a staggering 101 different mini-games spanning a wide variety of sports and activities. From classic favorites like bowling, tennis, and motocross to quirky and unique challenges like sack races and skateboarding, there's something for everyone.\n\nUtilizing the intuitive Wii Remote motion controls, players can immerse themselves in the action, mimicking the movements of real athletes. Compete head-to-head with up to four players locally, striving for high scores and unlocking even more games to play.  The simple, accessible gameplay makes it perfect for families and casual gamers, while the sheer volume of content ensures endless replayability.  Prepare for laughter, friendly rivalry, and non-stop sports-themed excitement! It's a party in a cartridge!"
    },
